{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Usually, there are many different ways to divide polynomials. Here, we will use the method of polynomial long division.\n\nNotice that the expression in the numerator is missing a $2^{\\text{nd}}$ degree term. To avoid any confusion, let's add that term as $0x^2$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{array}{r}\nx^2\\phantom{+5x-15}\n\\\\\nx-3|\\overline{x^3+0x^2-4x-15}\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{x^3-3x^2\\phantom{-4x-15}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n3x^2-4x-15\n\\end{array}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{array}{r}\nx^2+3x\\phantom{-15}\n\\\\\nx-3|\\overline{x^3+0x^2-4x-15}\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{x^3-3x^2\\phantom{-4x-15}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n3x^2-4x-15\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{3x^2-9x\\phantom{-15}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n5x-15\n\\end{array}$","images":{},"replace":true,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{array}{r}\nx^2+3x+\\phantom{1}5\n\\\\\nx-3|\\overline{x^3+0x^2-4x-15}\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{x^3-3x^2\\phantom{-4x-15}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n3x^2-4x-15\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{3x^2-9x\\phantom{-15}\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n5x-15\n\\\\\n\\mathllap{-(}\\underline{5x-15\\rlap )}\n\\\\\n0\n\\end{array}$","images":{},"replace":true,"widgets":{}},{"content":"We found that the quotient is $x^2+3x+5$ and the remainder is $0$, which means the answer is simply a polynomial (no expression of the form $\\dfrac{k}{x-3}$ ).\n\n$\\dfrac{x^3-4x-15}{x-3}=x^2+3x+5$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Divide the polynomials.**  \n*The form of your answer should either be $p(x)$ or $p(x)+\\dfrac{k}{x-3}$ where $p(x)$ is a polynomial and $k$ is an integer.*\n\n$\\dfrac{x^3-4x-15}{x-3}=$ [[☃ expression 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"expression 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerForms":[{"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"buttonsVisible":"focused","considered":"correct","form":true,"functions":["f","g","h"],"key":0,"linterContext":{"contentType":"","highlightLint":false,"paths":[],"stack":[]},"simplify":false,"times":false,"value":"x^{2}+3x+5"}],"buttonSets":["basic","prealgebra"],"functions":["f","g","h"],"static":false,"times":false},"static":false,"type":"expression","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
